# Optional local overrides. The checked-in defaults use CPU/Eigen and the
# verified official Renju model under this project directory.
#
# KATAGOMO_ENGINE=/absolute/path/to/katago
# KATAGOMO_MODEL=/absolute/path/to/zhizi_renju28b_s1600.bin.gz
# KATAGOMO_ANALYSIS_CONFIG=/absolute/path/to/analysis.cfg
# KATAGOMO_FORBIDDEN_HELPER=/absolute/path/to/forbidden_helper
# KATAGOMO_ENGINE_LOG=/absolute/path/to/engine-stderr.log
# KATAGOMO_PORT=8000

# OpenCL is opt-in because Apple's deprecated runtime is host-dependent. Use
# these together only after `make opencl` and a successful local smoke test.
# KATAGOMO_ENGINE=/absolute/path/to/build/engine-opencl/katago
# KATAGOMO_ANALYSIS_CONFIG=/absolute/path/to/config/analysis-opencl.cfg
